"(with non-breaking Space 0x00a0), Switzerland, Germany, Finland and Sweden.</"
"p><p><strong>&lsaquo;</strong> and <strong>&rsaquo;</strong> (U+2039/203a, "
"<code>&amp;lsaquo;/&amp;rsaquo;</code>) are their single quote equivalents.</"
"p><p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guillemets\">Wikipedia:"
"Guillemets</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>&laquo;</strong> (u+00ab, <code>&amp;lfquo;</code> v HTML) in "
"<strong>&raquo;</strong> (u+00bb, <code>&amp;rfquo;</code> v HTML) sta "
"poimenovana narekovaj zgoraj in spodaj. Uporaba v različnih državah: "
"Francija (z nedeljivim presledkom 0x00a0), Švica, Nemčija, Finska in Švedska."
"</p><p><strong>&lsaquo;</strong> in <strong>&rsaquo;</strong> (U+2039/203a, "
"<code>&amp;lsaquo;/&amp;rsaquo;</code>) sta enakovredna enojna narekovaja.</"
"p><p>Oglejte si <a href=\"https://sl.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
