#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_mask.xml
#: rc.cpp:2558
#, kde-format
msgid "VR360 Equirectangular Mask"
msgstr "Enakokotna maska VR360"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_mask.xml
#: rc.cpp:2560
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Adds a black matte to the frame. Use this if you filmed using a 360 camera "
"but only want to use part of the 360 image - for example if you and the film "
"crew occupy the 90 degrees behind the camera."
msgstr ""
"Sličici doda črno masko. To uporabite, če snemate s kamero 360, vendar "
"želite uporabiti le del 360-stopinjske slike - če npr. s snemalno ekipo "
"zasedate 90 stopinj za kamero."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_mask.xml
#: rc.cpp:2562
#, kde-format
msgid "Vertical start"
msgstr "Navpični začetek"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_mask.xml
#: rc.cpp:2564
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The <b>Start</b> is half the height in degrees of the un-matted area. The "
"<b>End</b> is the half the height in degrees where the matte is at 100%."
msgstr ""
"<b>Začetek</b> je polovica višine v stopinjah neprekritega območja. "
"<b>Konec</b> je polovica višine v stopinjah, kjer je maskiranje na 100 %."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_mask.xml
#: rc.cpp:2566
#, kde-format
msgid "Vertical end"
msgstr "Navpični konec"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_mask.xml
#: rc.cpp:2568
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The Start is half the height in degrees of the un-matted area. The End is "
"the half the height in degrees where the matte is at 100%."
msgstr ""
"Začetek je polovica višine v stopinjah območja brez maske. Konec je polovica "
"višine v stopinjah, kjer je maska 100 % prisotna."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_mask.xml
#: rc.cpp:2570
#, kde-format
msgid "Horizontal start"
msgstr "Vodoravni začetek"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_mask.xml
#: rc.cpp:2572 rc.cpp:2576
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The <b>Start</b> is the width in degrees of the un-matted area. The <b>End</"
"b> is the width in degrees where the matte is at 100%."
msgstr ""
"<b>Začetek</b> je širina v stopinjah nezakritega območja. <b>Konec</b> je "
"širina v stopinjah, kjer je maskiranje pri 100 %."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_mask.xml
#: rc.cpp:2574
#, kde-format
msgid "Horizontal end"
msgstr "Vodoravni konec"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_to_rect.xml
#: rc.cpp:2584
#, kde-format
msgid "VR360 Equirectangular to Rectilinear"
msgstr "Enakokotno v premočrtno VR360"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_to_rect.xml
#: rc.cpp:2586
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Converts an equirectangular frame (panoramic) to a rectilinear frame (what "
"you're used to seeing). Can be used to preview what will be shown in a 360 "
"video viewer. Delayed frame blitting mapped on a time bitmap"
msgstr ""
"Pretvori enakokotno sličico (panoramsko) v premočrtno sličico (kar ste "
"vajeni videti). Lahko se uporablja za predogled tega, kar bo prikazano v 360-"
"stopinjskem pregledovalniku videoposnetkov. Prenos bitnih blokov z "
"zakasnitvijo sličic, preslikan na časovni bitno sliko"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_to_rect.xml
#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_eq_to_stereo.xml
