#: rc.cpp:2666
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Converts a video frame with two hemispherical images to a single "
"equirectangular frame. The plugin assumes that both hemispheres are in the "
"frame"
msgstr ""
"Pretvori video sličico z dvema polkroglima slikama v eno enakokotno sličico. "
"Vstavek predpostavlja, da sta obe hemisferi v sličici"

