#: rc.cpp:2670 rc.cpp:2674 rc.cpp:2678
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The two fisheye cameras of a 360 camera are rarely perfectly 180 degrees "
"apart.<br>\n"
"    \tThese parameters adds a rotation to both lenses to correct for this."
msgstr ""
"Dve kameri z ribjim očesom 360-stopinjske kamere sta le redko popolno 180 "
"stopinj narazen.<br>\n"
"    \tTi parametri dodajo rotacijo obema objektivoma, da to popravite."

