#: rc.cpp:2720 rc.cpp:2724
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"360 cameras like the Theta have a problem with the nadir direction where, no "
"matter what, you will have a little of the camera in the image.<br>\n"
"    \tThis parameter \"stretches\" the image near nadir to cover up the "
"missing parts."
msgstr ""
"360-stopinjske kamere, kot je Theta, imajo težavo s smerjo podnožišča, kjer "
"ne glede na vse vidite del kamere v posnetku.<br>\n"
"    \tTa parameter »raztegne« sliko blizu podnožišča, da prikrije manjkajoče "
"dele."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2722
#, kde-format
msgid "Nadir start"
msgstr "Začetek podnožišča"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2726
#, kde-format
msgid "Lens distortion A"
msgstr "Popačenje objektiva A"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2728 rc.cpp:2732 rc.cpp:2736
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Lens distortion correction parameters.<br>\n"
"    \tThe first three parameters are the same as in Hugin."
msgstr ""
"Parametri korekcije popačenja objektiva.<br>\n"
"    \tPrvi trije parametri so enaki kot v Hugin."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2730
#, kde-format
msgid "Lens distortion B"
msgstr "Popačenje objektiva B"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2734
#, kde-format
msgid "Lens distortion C"
msgstr "Popačenje objektiva C"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2738
#, kde-format
msgid "Lens distortion radius"
msgstr "Polmer popačenja objektiva"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2740
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Lens distortion correction parameters.<br>\n"
"    \tIf you use Hugin parameters, the Radius should be set to the value of "
"(0.5 * min(image width, image height) / image width). For a 2:1 aspect dual "
"hemispherical image, that would be 0.25."
msgstr ""
"Parametri korekcije popačenja objektiva.<br>\n"
"    \tČe uporabljate parametre Hugin, je treba polmer nastaviti na vrednost "
"(0,5 * min(širina slike, višina slike) / širina slike). Za dvojno polkroglo "
"sliko v razmerju 2:1 bi to zneslo 0,25."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2742
#, kde-format
msgid "Lens vignetting A"
msgstr "Vinjetiranje objektiva A"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2744 rc.cpp:2748 rc.cpp:2752 rc.cpp:2756
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Lens vignetting correction parameters.<br>\n"
"    \tThe first four parameters are the same as in Hugin, corresponding to "
"the Va, Vb, Vc and Vd image parameters."
msgstr ""
"Parametri poprave vinjetiranja objektiva.<br>\n"
"    \tPrvi štirje parametri so enaki kot pri Huginu, ustrezajo parametrom "
"slike Va, Vb, Vc in Vd."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2746
#, kde-format
msgid "Lens vignetting B"
msgstr "Vinjetiranje objektiva B"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2750
#, kde-format
msgid "Lens vignetting C"
msgstr "Vinjetiranje objektiva C"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2754
#, kde-format
msgid "Lens vignetting D"
msgstr "Vinjetiranje objektiva D"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2758
#, kde-format
msgid "Lens vignetting radius"
msgstr "Polmer vinjetiranja objektiva"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2760
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you use Hugin parameters, the radius should be set to the value of (0.5 * "
"image diagonal / image width).<br>\n"
"    \tFor a 2:1 aspect dual hemispherical image, that would be 0.5590. Use "
"the A parameter to scale the effect and avoid overexposing highlights"
msgstr ""
"Če uporabljate parametre Hugin, mora biti polmer nastavljen na vrednost (0,5 "
"* diagonala slike / širina slike).<br>\n"
"    \tZa dvojno polkroglo sliko v razmerju 2: 1 bi to zneslo 0,5590. "
"Uporabite parameter A, da prilagodite velikost učinka in se izognete "
"preveliki ekspoziciji svetlih področij"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2762
#, kde-format
msgid "Use sensor response parameters"
msgstr "Uporabi parametre odziva tipala"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2764
#, kde-format
msgid "Switch on to use sensor response parameters (EMoR h(x))"
msgstr "Vklopite za uporabo parametrov odziva tipala (EMoR h(x))"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2766
#, kde-format
msgid "EMoR h(1)"
msgstr "EMoR h(1)"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2768 rc.cpp:2772 rc.cpp:2776 rc.cpp:2780 rc.cpp:2784
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Sensor response parameters.<br>\n"
"    \tThe EMoR h(x) parameters are the same as Hugin's Ra - Re in the lens "
"parameters. If you use Hugin-derived values for vignetting correction, you "
"should also use these parameters, as Hugin's vignetting correction assumes "
"that the sensor response has been corrected."
msgstr ""
"Parametri odziva tipala.<br>\n"
"    \tParametri EMoR h(x) so enaki kot Huginovi Ra - Re v parametrih "
"objektiva. Če za korekcijo vinjetiranja uporabljate vrednosti, ki izhajajo "
"iz Hugina, uporabite tudi te parametre, saj Huginova korekcija vinjetiranja "
"predpostavlja, da je bil odziv tipala popravljen."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2770
#, kde-format
msgid "EMoR h(2)"
msgstr "EMoR h(2)"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2774
#, kde-format
msgid "EMoR h(3)"
msgstr "EMoR h(3)"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2778
#, kde-format
msgid "EMoR h(4)"
msgstr "EMoR h(4)"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_hemi_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2782
#, kde-format
msgid "EMoR h(5)"
msgstr "EMoR h(5)"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_rect_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2790
#, kde-format
msgid "VR360 Rectilinear to Equirectangular"
msgstr "Premočrtno v enakokotno VR360"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_rect_to_eq.xml
#: rc.cpp:2792
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Converts a rectilinear (a normal-looking) image to an equirectangular image. "
"Use this together with Transform 360 to place \"normal\" footage in a 360 "
"movie."
msgstr ""
"Pretvori premočrtno (normalno) sliko v kvadratno cilindrično sliko. "
"Uporabite to skupaj s 360-stopinjsko pretvorbo, da postavite »običajne« "
"posnetke v 360-stopinjski film."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2802
#, kde-format
msgid "VR360 Stabilize"
msgstr "Stabilizacija VR360"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2804
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Stabilizes 360 footage.<br>\n"
"    The plugin works in two phases - analysis and stabilization. When "
"analyzing footage, it detects frame-to-frame rotation, and when stabilizing "
"it tries to correct high-frequency motion (shake)."
msgstr ""
"Stabilizira 360-stopinjske posnetke.<br>\n"
"    Vstavek deluje v dveh fazah - analiza in stabilizacija. Pri analizi "
"posnetkov zazna vrtenje od sličice do sličice in pri stabilizaciji poskuša "
"popraviti visokofrekvenčno gibanje (tresenje)."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2806
#, kde-format
msgid "Analyze"
msgstr "Analiziraj"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2808
#, kde-format
msgid "Switch on for analysis phase; switch off for stabilization phase."
msgstr "Vklopite za fazo analize, izklopite za stabilizacijo."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2810
#, kde-format
msgid "Motion analysis file"
msgstr "Datoteka analize gibanja"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2812
#, kde-format
msgid "Select the file to store stabilization data in"
msgstr "Izberite datoteko za shranjevanje stabilizacijskih podatkov"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2814
#, kde-format
msgid "Start offset"
msgstr "Začetni odmik"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2816
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The offset into the stabilization file that corresponds to the start of this "
"clip.<br>\n"
"    \tFor example, if you have a 30 second clip, analyze it all, and then "
"split it into three clips of 10 seconds each, then the start offsets should "
"be 0s, 10s, and 20s."
msgstr ""
"Odmik v stabilizacijsko datoteko, ki ustreza začetku tega posnetka.<br>\n"
"    \tČe imate npr. 30-sekundni posnetek, ga analizirate in ga nato "
"razdelite na tri posnetke po 10 sekund, potem bi morali biti začetni odmiki "
"0 s, 10 s in 20 s."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2818
#, kde-format
msgid "Analysis sample radius"
msgstr "Polmer vzorca analize"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2820
#, kde-format
msgid "The radius of the square that the stabilizer will sample"
msgstr "Polmer kvadrata, ki ga bo stabilizator vzorčil."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2822
#, kde-format
msgid "Analysis search radius"
msgstr "Iskalni polmer analize"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2824
#, kde-format
msgid "The maximum amount of motion the stabilizer will detect"
msgstr "Največja količina gibanja, ki jo bo stabilizator zaznal"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2826
#, kde-format
msgid "Analysis offset"
msgstr "Zamik analize"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2828
#, kde-format
msgid "The distance between the track points"
msgstr "Razdalja med točkami stez"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2830
#, kde-format
msgid "Use backwards-facing track points"
msgstr "Uporabi nazaj obrnjene točke sledenja"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2832
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If set, six backwards-facing track points will also be used to detect pitch "
"and yaw motion.<br>\n"
"    \tDisable if, for example, you show up holding the camera there"
msgstr ""
"Če je nastavljeno, bo tudi šest nazaj obrnjenih točk sledenja uporabljenih "
"za zaznavo gibanja nagiba in odklona.<br>\n"
"    \tOnemogočite, če se npr. prikažete, da držite kamero."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2834
#, kde-format
msgid "Yaw amount"
msgstr "Količina odklona"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2836 rc.cpp:2860
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The amount of stabilization to apply.<br>\n"
"    \t100% means that the stabilizer will make the camera as steady as it "
"can. Smaller values reduce the amount of stabilization."
msgstr ""
"Količina uveljavljene stabilizacije..<br>\n"
"    \t100 % pomeni, da bo stabilizator poskrbel, da bo kamera čim bolj "
"stabilna. Manjše vrednosti zmanjšajo količino stabilizacije."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2838
#, kde-format
msgid "Yaw smoothing"
msgstr "Glajenje z odklonom"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2840
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The number of frames to use to smooth out the shakes. The higher the value, "
"the slower the camera will follow any intended motion."
msgstr ""
"Število sličic, uporabljenih za glajenje tresljajev. Višja kot je vrednost, "
"počasneje bo kamera sledila predvidenemu gibanju."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2842
#, kde-format
msgid "Yaw time bias"
msgstr "Časovno odstopanje odklona"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2844 rc.cpp:2856 rc.cpp:2868
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Shift the frames used to smooth out the shakes relative to the stabilized "
"frame.<br>\n"
"    \tA value less than zero will give more weight to past frames, and the "
"camera will seem to lag behind intended movement. A value greater than zero "
"will give more weight to future frames, and the camera will appear to move "
"ahead of the intended camera movement. A value of zero should make the "
"camera follow the intended path."
msgstr ""
"Zamaknite sličice, ki se uporabljajo za glajenje tresljajev, glede na "
"stabilizirano sličico.<br>\n"
"    \tVrednost, manjša od nič, bo dala večjo težo preteklim sličicam, zato "
"se bo zdelo, da kamera zaostaja za nameravanim gibanjem. Vrednost, večja od "
"nič, bo dala večjo težo prihodnjim sličicam in zdelo se bo, da se kamera "
"premika pred predvidenim gibanjem kamere. Pri vrednosti nič naj bi kamera "
"sledila predvideni poti."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2846
#, kde-format
msgid "Pitch amount"
msgstr "Količina nagibanja"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2848
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The amount of stabilization to apply. 100% means that the stabilizer will "
"make the camera as steady as it can. Smaller values reduce the amount of "
"stabilization."
msgstr ""
"Količina uveljavljene stabilizacije. 100 % pomeni, da bo stabilizator "
"poskrbel, da bo kamera čim bolj stabilna. Manjše vrednosti zmanjšajo "
"količino stabilizacije."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2850
#, kde-format
msgid "Pitch smoothing"
msgstr "Glajenje z nagibanjem"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2852 rc.cpp:2864
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The number of frames to use to smooth out the shakes.<br>\n"
"    \tThe higher the value, the slower the camera will follow any intended "
"motion."
msgstr ""
"Število sličic, uporabljenih za glajenje tresljajev. <br>\n"
"    \tVišja kot je vrednost, počasneje bo kamera sledila predvidenemu "
"gibanju."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2854
#, kde-format
msgid "Pitch time bias"
msgstr "Časovno odstopanje nagiba"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2858
#, kde-format
msgid "Roll amount"
msgstr "Količina kotaljenja"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2862
#, kde-format
msgid "Roll smoothing"
msgstr "Glajenje s kotaljenjem"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_stabilize_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2866
#, kde-format
msgid "Roll time bias"
msgstr "Časovno odstopanje kotaljenja"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_bigsh0t_transform_360.xml
#: rc.cpp:2874
#, kde-format
