"eno sličico, s čimer ustvari nov posnetek z dvojno višino s polovico "
"hitrosti sličic in polovico števila sličic."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_weave.xml
#: rc.cpp:7434
#, kde-format
msgid "Top,Bottom"
msgstr "zgoraj,spodaj"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_xbr.xml
#: rc.cpp:7436
#, kde-format
msgid "xBR Interpolator"
msgstr "Interpolator xBR"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_xbr.xml
#: rc.cpp:7438
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Apply the xBR high-quality magnification filter which is designed for pixel "
"art. It follows a set of edge-detection rules."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite visokokakovostni filter za povečavo xBR, ki je zasnovan za "
"točkovne slike. Sledi nizu pravil za zaznavanje robov."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_xbr.xml
#: rc.cpp:7440
#, kde-format
msgid "Scaling dimension"
msgstr "Mera skaliranja"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_xbr.xml
#: rc.cpp:7442
#, kde-format
msgid "2x BR,3x BR,4x BR"
msgstr "2x BR,3x BR,4x BR"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_yadif.xml
#: rc.cpp:7444
#, kde-format
msgid "Yadif Deinterlacer"
msgstr "Razpletalnik yadif"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_yadif.xml
#: rc.cpp:7446
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Deinterlace the input video (\"yadif\" means \"yet another deinterlacing "
"filter\")"
msgstr ""
"Odstranite prepletanje vhodnega videa (»yadif« pomeni »yet another "
"deinterlacing filter« oz. »še en filter za odstranjevanje prepletanja«)"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_yadif.xml
#: rc.cpp:7450
#, kde-format
msgid "Send frame,Send field,Send frame nospatial,Send field nospatial"
msgstr ""
"pošlji sličico,pošlji polsliko,pošlji sličico brezprostorsko,pošlji polsliko "
"brezprostorsko"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_yadif.xml
#: rc.cpp:7454
#, kde-format
msgid "Top field first,Bottom field first,Auto"
msgstr "najprej zgornja polslika,najprej spodnja polslika,samodejno"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_zoompan.xml
#: rc.cpp:7460
#, kde-format
msgid "Zoom Pan"
msgstr "Približanje in zasuk"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_zoompan.xml
#: rc.cpp:7462
#, kde-format
msgid "Apply Zoom and Pan effect"
msgstr "Uveljavite učinek povečave in zasuka"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/subtitles.xml
#: rc.cpp:7474
#, kde-format
msgid "Render subtitles onto the video"
msgstr "Izrišite podnapise v videoposnetek"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/subtitles.xml
#: rc.cpp:7476
#, kde-format
msgid "Subtitle file to apply"
msgstr "Datoteka s podnapisi za uporabo"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_1185.xml
#: rc.cpp:7478
#, kde-format
msgid "Diode Processor"
msgstr "Procesor diode"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_1185.xml
#: rc.cpp:7480
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Diode Processor (LADSPA 1185)<br>\n"
"   Mangles the signal as if it had been passed through a diode rectifier "
"network. You should probably follow this with a <i>DC Offset Remover</i>, "
"unless you want the offset."
msgstr ""
"Diodni procesor (LADSPA 1185)<br>\n"
"   Signal spremeni tako, kot da bi ga preusmerila diodna usmerniška mreža. "
"Po tem najverjetneje sledi uporaba <i>odstranjevalnika enosmernega odmika</"
"i>, razen če želite ta odmik ohraniti."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_1185.xml
#: rc.cpp:7484
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The <i>Mode</i> parameter is<br>\n"
"      continuously variable from thru to half-wave (1) rectification to full-"
"wave (2) to silence (0)"
msgstr ""
"Parameter <i>Način</i> je<br>\n"
"      neprekinjeno spremenljiv od prehodnega do polvalovnega (1) usmerjanja "
"do polnovalovnega (2) usmerjanja do tišine (0)"

