#. i18n: file: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_1913.xml
#: rc.cpp:8144
#, kde-format
msgid "Fast Lookahead Limiter"
msgstr "Hitri omejevalnik s pogledom naprej"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_1913.xml
#: rc.cpp:8146
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Fast Lookahead Limiter (LADSPA 1913)<br>\n"
"   This is a limiter with an attack time of 5ms. It adds just over 5ms of "
"latency to the input signal, but it guarantees that there will be no signals "
"over the limit, and tries to get the minimum amount of distortion."
msgstr ""
"Hitri omejevalnik s pogledom naprej (LADSPA 1913)<br>\n"
"   To je omejevalnik s časom napada 5 ms. Doda nekaj več kot 5 ms zakasnitve "
"vhodnemu signalu, vendar zagotavlja, da ne bo signalov nad omejitvijo in "
"poskuša doseči najmanjšo količino popačenja."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_1913.xml
#: rc.cpp:8150
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Gain that is applied<br>\n"
"      to the input stage. Can be used to trim gain to bring it roughly under "
"the limit or to push the signal against the limit."
msgstr ""
"Ojačitev, ki se uporablja<br>\n"
"      do vhodne faze. Lahko se uporablja za zmanjšanje ojačitve, da se "
"približa meji, ali za potiskanje signala proti meji."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_1913.xml
#: rc.cpp:8154
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The maximum output amplitude.<br>\n"
"      Peaks over this level will be attenuated as smoothly as possible to "
"bring them as close as possible to this level."
msgstr ""
"Največja izhodna amplituda.<br>\n"
"      Vrhovi nad to ravnjo bodo čim bolj gladko oslabljeni, da se čim bolj "
"približajo tej ravni."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_1913.xml
#: rc.cpp:8158
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The time taken for the<br>\n"
"      limiters attenuation to return to 0 dB"
msgstr ""
"Čas, potreben za<br>\n"
"      Oslabitev omejevalnika, da se povrne na 0 dB"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_1913.xml
